 *   **Parameter Range**: $p \in (0, \infty)$ [S1].
-*   **Properties**: Continuous, continuously differentiable, strict, Archimedean.
-*   **When to choose**: Useful for interpolating between probabilistic and Einstein behaviors by tuning $p$.
